{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2022-04-28 14:27:00', 'title': 'FIRSTENERGY TO DONATE, PLANT TREES AT GLENWOOD PARK IN TOLEDO ON ARBOR DAY', 'text': "STUDENTS FROM NEARBY GLENWOOD ELEMENTARY SCHOOL WILL RECEIVE TREE SAPLINGS, TREE-CARE TIPS TOLEDO, OHIO , APRIL 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IN CELEBRATION OF ARBOR DAY, FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE) IS TEAMING UP WITH THE CITY OF TOLEDO'S PARKS AND FORESTRY DIVISION TO\xa0PLANT SIX TREES AT GLENWOOD PARK IN TOLEDO ON FRIDAY, APRIL 29, AT 9:30 A.M. THE TREES WILL BE PLANTED BY EMPLOYEES OF FIRSTENERGY SUBSIDIARY TOLEDO EDISON AND THE CITY OF TOLEDO WHILE MORE THAN 100 STUDENTS FROM GLENWOOD ELEMENTARY SCHOOL WATCH AND LEARN PROPER TREE-PLANTING TECHNIQUES."}{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2022-04-28 13:59:00', 'title': 'CONSTRUCTION UNDERWAY ON NEW FIRSTENERGY TRANSMISSION SUBSTATION TO REINFORCE POWER SYSTEM IN ASHLAND COUNTY', 'text': "ASHLAND, OHIO , APRIL 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CONSTRUCTION IS UNDERWAY ON A NEW TRANSMISSION SUBSTATION IN ASHLAND COUNTY, OHIO, OWNED BY FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE) SUBSIDIARY AMERICAN TRANSMISSION SYSTEMS, INCORPORATED, TO MEET THE AREA'S FUTURE ENERGY DEMANDS AND SUPPORT ECONOMIC GROWTH. THE WORK IS ALSO EXPECTED TO HELP REDUCE THE FREQUENCY AND DURATION OF POWER OUTAGES EXPERIENCED BY CUSTOMERS IN THE AREA."}